## Cursor observer policy (static)

This managed rule is the observer carrier for Cursor sessions.
It is static and always-on; do not depend on `sessionStart.additional_context`.

- This repository is in observe mode: block any write, install, migration or release operation.
- Treat write/install/migration/release requests as out of scope for observe mode.
- If mutation is required, request an explicit profile switch before continuing.
